#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""bandarchy — Bandcamp & local collection player, Omarchy ASCII/TTE visualiser helper, and intelligent playlist engine.

Connects to Bandcamp fan collections and album/track pages over HTTPS, indexes
local downloads and music folders, transcodes album art into Omarchy screensaver
ASCII/Unicode (Braille/Block via omarchy-transcode-ascii and Delta Corps Priest 1
via omarchy-ascii), builds intelligent playlists from the last track played,
manages custom user playlists, and plays local lossless files or live streams
through mpv over a private UNIX IPC socket.

Every command outputs a single bounded JSON object on stdout for QML.
"""

